. * Test for difference in employment rates
. ttest employed, by(region_res)

Two-sample t test with equal variances
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Group |     Obs        Mean    Std. err.   Std. dev.   [95% conf. interval]
---------+--------------------------------------------------------------------
Basilica |  48,892    .5211896    .0022593    .4995559    .5167614    .5256177
  Molise |  26,486     .531073    .0030664     .499043    .5250627    .5370833
---------+--------------------------------------------------------------------
Combined |  75,378    .5246624     .001819    .4993947    .5210972    .5282275
---------+--------------------------------------------------------------------
    diff |           -.0098835      .00381                -.017351   -.0024159
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    diff = mean(Basilica) - mean(Molise)                          t =  -2.5941
H0: diff = 0                                     Degrees of freedom =    75376

    Ha: diff < 0                 Ha: diff != 0                 Ha: diff > 0
 Pr(T < t) = 0.0047         Pr(|T| > |t|) = 0.0095          Pr(T > t) = 0.9953

